    [18957]={name="Brushwood Blade",quality=2,ilvl=10,reqLevel=3,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Druid of the Claw'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Oben Rageclaw in Teldrassil. Objective: Oben Rageclaw wants you to kill his soulless body, and then use the Voodoo Charm.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Druid of the Claw",lore="After examining this charm, I see now what must be done. Please take it, and do as I ask. You are to explore the deepest areas of the Ban'ethil Barrow Den."},
    [19024]={name="Arena Grand Master",quality=3,ilvl=55,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arena Grandmaster'. Starts with Short John Mithril in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: ProgressAvast Lubber! &nbsp; Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena! &nbsp; Arrrr!",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Arena Grandmaster",lore="Avast Lubber! Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena!",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Dodge an attack by 1.0%."},
    [19040]={name="Zorbin's Mega-Slicer",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zapped Giants'. Starts with Zorbin Fandazzle in Feralas. Objective: Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 15 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Zapped Giants",lore="I'm going to have to do something about the giants if I stay out here! They're certainly not good for business, now are they?"},
